| Score | Standard |
|---:|---|
| 4 | Clear leader with sustainable advantage |
| 3 | Strong top-tier position |
| 2 | Competitive but not advantaged |
| 1 | Weak position |
| 0 | Structurally disadvantaged |

Avoid double-counting moat.

